Interchange StudentTranscript [2535]
    documentation 'This interchange defines transcript information for a course and student 
                  'academic records for a given session. Course transcripts link to the student 
                  'academic record for the session in which the course was taken.
    use case documentation '1. Exchange a student's full or partial academic record.
                           '
                           '2. Exchange a transcript for a course or set of courses.
    element StudentAcademicRecord [2535-001]
    element CourseTranscript [2535-002]
    element ExternalEducationOrganization [2535-003]
    element ExternalStudentAcademicRecord [2535-004]
    element ExternalCourseTranscript  [2535-005]